title: devcontainer-airlock
abstract: >
  Secure, layered devcontainers for AI coding agents: a workbench per agent
  with no GitHub token and no ssh key, isolated containers with no network
  for hooks, tests and installs, a GitHub broker, an ssh-agent and an egress
  proxy, built and scanned in CI and consumed by digest.
